# =============================================================================
# PURE PLOMBERIE INC - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# =============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# 1. NEVER commit your real `.env` file to git. `.env` is listed in `.gitignore`.
# 2. VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are exposed to the browser.
#    They are ONLY safe because PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) is strictly enforced.
# 3. NEVER prefix the `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` with `VITE_` or include it in client code!
#    The service role key bypasses all RLS and must ONLY be configured in Vercel server environment variables.
# 4. If any admin credentials, database passwords, or personal access tokens were ever
#    committed to git, rotate them immediately in your respective dashboards.
# =============================================================================

# Client-Side Supabase Configuration (Safe with RLS enabled)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-publishable-anon-key-here

# Server-Side Only (Optional - for Vercel Serverless Functions / Webhooks)
# MUST NEVER BE PREFIXED WITH VITE_
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key-here
